    "text": "If we consider the opposite process <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ; <math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ; <math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ; <math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math